abstract = {With the development of cloud computing, cloud resource pool and SAAS are important evolution trends. The log records the failure events of the equipment to provide essential data support for the operation evaluation. This paper analyzes the different exception log patterns in cloud resource pools, and proposes an integrated log anomaly detection algorithm, and deploys a SAAS application. Experimental results show that the proposed algorithm has higher prediction performance than PCA and clustering algorithms, with an average Precision improvement of about 7%. In addition, we analyzed the request distribution of the components in the SAAS and optimized the loading order of the components.},
