abstract = {With the continuous progress of information technology and power industry, multi-site fusion has become one of the key components of the ubiquitous power Internet of Things. In this article, a new scheme for automatic operation and maintenance is introduced, so as to meet the technical requirements of automatic operation and maintenance. In addition, this scheme can automatically manage resources and improve the efficiency for operation and maintenance in cloud data centers.},
